  "title": "<strong>Dontae Peeps Shares A New Single Track, \"Ordinary Love\"</strong>",
  "htmlContent": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"<strong>Ordinary Love</strong>,\" a single from USA-based artist <strong>Dontae Peeps</strong> is a blend of R&amp;B and Indie/Alternative.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The song's lyrics tackle loneliness and longing for love in life. The smooth melody combined with soulful vocals creates a soft yet powerful atmosphere.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4PlD6udNwNznNfqlAwvxw4\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"spotify\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-spotify wp-block-embed-spotify wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://open.spotify.com/track/4PlD6udNwNznNfqlAwvxw4\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This relatable track will indeed connect with listeners and have them singing along.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>CLICK HERE TO STREAM: Dontae Peeps's \"<a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4PlD6udNwNznNfqlAwvxw4\">Ordinary Love</a>.\" on Spotify</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>CONNECT WITH Dontae Peeps: <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/itspeepdis/\">Instagram</a> | <a href=\"https://twitter.com/OFFICIALDPEEPS\">Twitter</a> | <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/IAMPEEPS/\">Facebook</a> | <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@peepdiz\">TikTok</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
